# single-cell (homelab#3140): harnessB EMPTY = a one-cell series; no leg B is read, no dead cell is
# declared, and the report is filed under the SERIES name, not the stack's.
single-cell                  |       |       | HARNESS_B= SERIES=feedback-triage LOG_B_NAME=never-written DECLARE_HARVEST_INPUTS=1     | delivered-single    | a_dest=opus a_served=claude:opus
